          <span class="tapln">눌러서 세부내역 보기 ↓</span>
        </button>
        <button class="kpitile" id="tile-tire" onclick="selectAccKpi('tire')" aria-pressed="false">
          <span class="rank">02</span>
          <span class="eyebrow">타이어 · 인보이스금액</span>
          <span class="value">₩{{ '{:,}'.format(tire.total) }}</span>
          <span class="foot">원가 ₩{{ '{:,}'.format(tire.cost) }} · {{ tire.invoices_count }}건 · {{ tire.lines }}라인</span>
          <span class="tapln">눌러서 세부내역 보기 ↓</span>
        </button>
      </div>

