          </div>
          <p class="subttl">부품타입별 인보이스금액 <span class="n">코드순</span></p>
          <div class="tablewrap">
            <table>
              <thead><tr><th>코드</th><th>부품타입</th><th class="num">라인</th><th class="num">인보이스금액</th></tr></thead>
              <tbody>
                {% for r in acc.by_type %}
                <tr><td class="mono">{{ r.code }}</td><td>{{ r.label }}</td><td class="num">{{ r.lines }}</td><td class="num">{{ '{:,}'.format(r.val) }}</td></tr>
                {% endfor %}
                <tr class="subtotal"><td colspan="2">3+5+7 합계</td><td class="num">{{ acc.lines }}</td><td class="num">{{ '{:,}'.format(acc.total) }}</td></tr>
              </tbody>
            </table>
          </div>
          <p class="subttl" style="margin-top:16px">인보이스 최근 5건 <span class="n">최신일순 · RO 또는 SP번호</span></p>
          <div class="tablewrap">
            <table>
              <thead><tr><th>RO/SP번호</th><th>인보이스번호</th><th>거래처</th><th>일시</th><th class="num">인보이스금액</th><th class="num">원가</th></tr></thead>
              <tbody>
                {% for r in acc.recent5 %}
                <tr><td class="mono">{{ r.num }}</td><td class="mono">{{ r.inv }}</td><td>{{ r.cust }}</td><td class="mono">{{ r.dt }}</td><td class="num">{{ '{:,}'.format(r.amt) }}</td><td class="num">{{ '{:,}'.format(r.cost) }}</td></tr>
                {% endfor %}
              </tbody>
            </table>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div id="detail-tire" hidden>
          <div class="viewer-head">
            <span class="lbl">타이어 세부 (부품타입 8)</span>
            <span class="val">₩{{ '{:,}'.format(tire.total) }}</span>
            <span class="foot">원가 ₩{{ '{:,}'.format(tire.cost) }} · 정산유형 C(고객)+I(내부처리)</span>
          </div>
          <p class="subttl">담당 SA별 실적 <span class="n">인보이스금액순</span></p>
          <div class="tablewrap">
            <table>
              <thead><tr><th>담당SA</th><th class="num">품목수량합계</th><th class="num">인보이스금액</th><th class="num">마진금액</th></tr></thead>
              <tbody>
                {% for r in tire.by_sa %}
                <tr><td>{{ r.sa }}</td><td class="num">{{ r.qty }}</td><td class="num">{{ '{:,}'.format(r.val) }}</td><td class="num{{ ' neg' if r.margin < 0 else '' }}">{{ '{:,}'.format(r.margin) }}</td></tr>
                {% endfor %}
                <tr class="subtotal"><td>합계</td><td class="num">{{ tire.qty_total }}</td><td class="num">{{ '{:,}'.format(tire.total) }}</td><td class="num">{{ '{:,}'.format(tire.margin_total) }}</td></tr>
              </tbody>
            </table>
          </div>
          <p class="subttl" style="margin-top:16px">인보이스 전체 {{ tire.invoices_count }}건 <span class="n">최신일순</span></p>
          <div class="tablewrap">
            <table>
              <thead><tr><th>RO/SP번호</th><th>인보이스번호</th><th>거래처</th><th>일시</th><th class="num">인보이스금액</th><th class="num">원가</th></tr></thead>
              <tbody>
                {% for r in tire.all_invoices %}
                <tr><td class="mono">{{ r.num }}</td><td class="mono">{{ r.inv }}</td><td>{{ r.cust }}</td><td class="mono">{{ r.dt }}</td><td class="num">{{ '{:,}'.format(r.amt) }}</td><td class="num">{{ '{:,}'.format(r.cost) }}</td></tr>
                {% endfor %}
              </tbody>
            </table>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
